<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] · Comercial Manufacturera LTDA.</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/dist/styles.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="auth-shell">
        <aside class="auth-story" aria-label="Comercial Manufacturera LTDA.">
            <a class="brand" asp-controller="Login" asp-action="Index"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">cm</span><span class="brand-name">Comercial Manufacturera LTDA.</span></a>
            <div class="story-content">
                <p class="eyebrow">GESTIÓN COMERCIAL & INVENTARIO</p>
                <h1>Cada venta.<br />Cada producto.<br /><span>Todo en su lugar.</span></h1>
                <p class="story-copy">Un espacio para conectar tus cotizaciones, ventas y existencias por bodega.</p>
                <div class="flow-card">
                    <p class="eyebrow">UN PROCESO CONECTADO</p>
                    <div class="flow-steps"><span>Cotiza</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b><span>Reserva</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b><span>Vende</span></div>
                    <p class="flow-caption">Del primer acuerdo al movimiento de inventario.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="story-footer">Comercial Manufacturera LTDA. · Tu operación, con claridad.</p>
        </aside>
        <main class="auth-main"><div class="auth-card">@RenderBody()</div></main>
    </div>
    <script type="module" src="~/dist/login.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
</body>
</html>
